1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From La Voz del Pueblo (Las Vegas, NM) of Saturday, Oct. 25, 1919:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Candelario Urioste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT A los 22 anos de edad fellecio en Albuquerque el dia 17 del presente, de una pulmonia, el Sr. Candelario Urioste, dejando para llorar su separacion a su esposa, una hija y muchos otros parientes.
2 CONT
2 CONT (At 22 years of age, in Albuquerque, on the 17th inst., of pneumonia, Mr. Candelario Urioste, leaving his wife, a daughter and many other relatives to mourn his separation.) E. P. D.
