1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Empapa Jose, as Grandpa O.V. Torres called him, was burried inside the San Francisco Church in Tercio, Las Animas County, CO.  The ruins of the church are still visible today. It is located at the Tercio Cemetery. 
2 CONC That means that babies, Brigida, Ma. Barbara Clorinda, and maybe Ma. Manuela de la Encarnacion are burried within the church too.
