2 FILE https://media.geni.com/p13/fb/fd/89/7b/5344483c9e02fab8/qep43pep_original.jpg?hash=4d8ef205c2fc1aeeca88abb1e2c6eb2cf80e92988df5804b7819e22eecbdc70b.1797235199
2 FORM jpg
2 TITL Hay Rake Drawing Mercer Museum
2 _PRIM Y
2 NOTE That is amazing.  How did you happen to find that?  Would love to know the story behind the sketch.  
3 CONT The nickname that most people knew him by, Pete, was given to him by his dad.  They had a prized Mule named Pete, when he was a little boy.  This picture doesn't look like a mule, might have been one of the Belgian work Horses.
3 CONT I'll try to post a picture of Dad with the rare twin Mules that was published in a farm magazine.
3 CONT
3 CONT Thanks,
3 CONT Linda 
