2 CONT Marcela in Sapello - From Sapello Marriages HGRC- in this parish of Sapello, Dec 25, 1885 dispensing with the banns because it was a prohibited time and 3rd degree consanguinity, I married Manuel Sanchez leg. S/ Matias Sanchez and
2 CONC  Josefita Lopez with Marcela Gilbert, single s/ William Gilbert and Antonia Rivera both from El Rincon, Wit/ Rafael Sanchez and Apolonia Ramirez. Page 15
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 238 Mora NM Baptisms (HGRC-NM) 11/21/1869 baptized Marcela Gilbert 12 days old legitimate d/o Guaren Gilbert and Tonita Ribera. Padrinos: Remigio Garcia and Maria Garcia.
