1 NAME Manuel Luis /Terrazas/ II
2 GIVN Manuel Luis
2 SURN Terrazas
2 NSFX II
2 _MARNM Terrazas
1 NAME Manuel Terrazas
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 4 OCT 1884
2 PLAC San Marcial
2 ADDR
3 STAE New Mexico
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 APR 1970
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Orphaned at age 2.  Mother remarried and the family moved from San Marcial NM to McGaffey NM, where Manuel Luis became a rancher, farmer, and lumberman.  He married Candelaria Lucero and the couple had nine childre
2 CONC n, the eldest also Manuel Terrazas.  
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1900 census is the first census record in which Manuel Luis Terrazas appears.  He is listed as a step son, age 14 with the surname GOMEZ as is his brother Nabor with his mother and stepfather, Fernandes Silva – consistent with
2 CONC  the family oral history.  The Gomez family to whom the boys were given to be raised was undoubtably the family of Nabor Gomez, Maria Fabiana’s first husband.  The final record found for Maria Fabiana Silva was in the 1930 census:
2 CONC  Lilly Blackwell, 48, married at 13 years old (no husband listed); Fabiana Sylva, married at 17 years old (no husband listed), 75, mother, are listed in the 1930 census living together in Gallup McKinley Co., NM.  Lilly (Maria Lib
2 CONC rada Gomez) was the second child of Nabor Gomez and Maria Fabiana and had been married twice.  The first marriage was to Hipolito Pineda in 1888 in Socorro and the second to William C Blackwell about February 1910 probably in Gall
2 CONC up.
2 CONT
2 CONT The next record for Manuel Luis is his World War I Registration Card: Manuel Terrazas gave his DOB as 20 Oct 1885, listed his nearest relative as Candelaria Terrazas, stated they were living in Perea (AKA Coolidge), (Near Fort Win
2 CONC gate) McKinnley Co., NM, and he worked for the McGalley (Saw) Mill on this (WW I Draft) Registration Card on 12 Sep 1918.
2 CONT
2 CONT No record of Manuel Luis Terrazas has been found in the 1920 census, however the family appears twice in the 1930 census. Manuel Terrazas, 42, married at age 18 to Candelaria Lucero, 40, and 5 children are listed in the 1930 censu
2 CONC s living together in Precinct 16, Valencia, Bernalillo Co., NM.  They are also listed in living together in Ramah, McKinley Co, NM in the 1930 census as follows: Manuel Terrazas, 43; Candelaria Terrazas. 41; Carlota Terrazas, 18; 
2 CONC Lucy Terrazas, 12; Nick Terrazas, 10; Margaret Terrazas, 7; Earnest Terrazas, 4, are listed in the 1930 census living together in Ramah, McKinley Co., NM.  Note - his daughter Carlota is also listed living with the Zimmerman famil
2 CONC y in Ramah as their servant.
