1 NAME Lupe /Arguello/
2 GIVN Lupe
2 SURN Arguello
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Pueblo, Pueblo County, Colorado, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 APR 1913
