2 CONT
2 CONT Ken A. Esquibel (born June 30, 1959) is a former Democratic member of the Wyoming House of Representatives, representing the 41st district from 2007 to 2017.
2 CONT
2 CONT Esquibel is the brother of Floyd Esquibel, also a former state legislator in Wyoming. He is Hispanic.[1]
