1 NAME Peter Damian /Pulido/
2 GIVN Peter Damian
2 SURN Pulido
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Pueblo, Pueblo County, Colorado, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 FEB 1934
2 PLAC Pueblo County, Colorado, USA
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 18 APR 2011
2 PLAC Pueblo, Pueblo County, Colorado, United States of America
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Wednesday, April 20, 2011 Pueblo Chieftain Pete Damian Pulido, 77, of Pueblo, went to be with the Lord on April 18, 2011. He is preceded in death by his sisters, Candy Butkovich and Irene Pulido. Pete is survived by his children, 
2 CONC Damian Pulido and Sharon (Bartel Oliea) Velasquez; mother of his children, Isabel Ulibarri; grandchildren, Kress, Desirae, Anastasia Pulido, Tommy and Cheryl Velasquez; sisters, Connie Jo, Gloria, Betty Ann, Angela, Julie, and Lal
2 CONC a; brother, Paul; and numerous nieces, nephews, extended family and friends. Viewing 12 to 6p.m. Thursday, with Rosary service to follow at 6p.m. at Romero Chapel. Funeral service 10a.m. Friday, Romero Chapel. Cremation to follow.
2 CONC  Family and friends will be received at Romero Courtesy Hall following service. Military honors by the Pueblo Veterans Ritual Team
