1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Vigil, Eloy Jose, b. 06/01/1916, d. 06/09/1955, PFC CO D 20 INF REGT 6 INF DIV USA, Plot: V 133, bur. 06/14/1955,
2 CONT
2 CONT On 16 Oct 1940; Eloy (B: Mora), a resident of Rock Springs, Wyoming; registered for the World War II draft in Rock Springs. He was described as: 6' 2", 175 pounds, brown eyes, black hair, dark brown complexion, mole on right cheek
2 CONC , and that his left arm had been broken. His father was identified as Jose Ines Vigil of Guadalupita (draft card).
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT PFC US ARMY
2 CONT COMPANY D 20 INFANTRY REGIMENT
