0 @N6000000002279616357@ NOTE MARIA TRUJILLO Y SANCHEZ:
1 CONT Juan de Trujillo and his wife, Elvira Sanchez Jimenez, both natives of the Rio Abajo, returned with the Reconquest....he was in all probability the Juan de Trujillo who passed muster in 1681, and the son of old Francisco Trujillo.
1 CONC ... His two know children were Maria, wife of Juan de Mestas Peralta, and Antonio, married to Ana Maria de Cordoba.
1 CONT Fray Angelico Chavez, Origins of New Mexico Families, Revised Edition 1992, p 296.
